  "solution": {
    "approach": "Check if character is a vowel (A, E, I, O, U) case-insensitively, else consonant.",
    "timeComplexity": "O(1)",
    "spaceComplexity": "O(1)",
    "code": {
      "C": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <ctype.h>\n\nint main() {\n    char ch;\n    if (scanf(\" %c\", &ch) == 1) {\n        char c = tolower(ch);\n        if (c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u') {\n            printf(\"Vowel\\n\");\n        } else {\n            printf(\"Consonant\\n\");\n        }\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "C++": "#include <iostream>\n#include <cctype>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    char ch;\n    if (cin >> ch) {\n        char c = tolower(ch);\n        if (c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u') cout << \"Vowel\\n\";\n        else cout << \"Consonant\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "Java": "import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        if (sc.hasNext()) {\n            char c = Character.toLowerCase(sc.next().charAt(0));\n            if (\"aeiou\".indexOf(c) != -1) System.out.println(\"Vowel\");\n            else System.out.println(\"Consonant\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
      "Python3": "import sys\n\ndef main():\n    s = sys.stdin.read().strip()\n    if s:\n        c = s[0].lower()\n        print(\"Vowel\" if c in \"aeiou\" else \"Consonant\")\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n",
      "JavaScript": "const fs = require('fs');\n\nfunction main() {\n    const s = fs.readFileSync(0, 'utf-8').trim();\n    if (s.length > 0) {\n        const c = s[0].toLowerCase();\n        console.log(\"aeiou\".includes(c) ? \"Vowel\" : \"Consonant\");\n    }\n}\n\nmain();\n"
    },
    "notes": "Ensure edge case and standard I/O format handling.",
    "editorial": "Convert to lowercase and check against 'aeiou'. Print 'Vowel' or 'Consonant'."
  },
